     "body": "<p>Resolved as of <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/commit/93a8e636ab22559a9100eedea20f83f8bb9077d6\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">93a8e63</a></p>\n\n<p>&gt; curl -i -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPATCH -H\"Content-type: application/sparql-update\" -d \"INSERT </p>\n{ &lt;&gt; &lt;[http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains]&gt; &lt;[http://localhost:8080/rest/other]&gt; .}\n<p> WHERE { }\" [http://localhost:8080/rest/test<br/>\n]<br/>\n HTTP/1.1 409 Conflict<br/>\n Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2020 22:33:26 GMT<br/>\n Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID=node0na9swtu0iujj11fggrzw310oo2.node0; Path=/<br/>\n Expires: Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT<br/>\n Set-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/; Max-Age=0; Expires=Thu, 12-Nov-2020 22:33:26 GMT; SameSite=lax<br/>\n Content-Type: text/plain;charset=utf-8<br/>\n Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/static/constraints/ServerManagedPropertyException.rdf\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/static/constraints/ServerManagedPropertyException.rdf</a>&gt;; rel=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#constrainedBy\"<br/>\n Content-Length: 99<br/>\n Server: Jetty(9.4.34.v20201102)</p>\n\n<p>The server managed predicate (<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains</a>) cannot be modified by the client.</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>&gt; curl -i -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPATCH -H\"Content-type: application/sparql-update\" -d \"DELETE </p>\n{ &lt;&gt; &lt;[http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains]&gt; ?o }\n<p> WHERE </p>\n{ &lt;&gt; &lt;[http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains]&gt; ?o }\n<p>\" [http://localhost:8080/rest/test<br/>\n]<br/>\n HTTP/1.1 409 Conflict<br/>\n Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2020 22:34:04 GMT<br/>\n Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID=node0ljza7witwjq01nws3wzxgfri03.node0; Path=/<br/>\n Expires: Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT<br/>\n Set-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/; Max-Age=0; Expires=Thu, 12-Nov-2020 22:34:04 GMT; SameSite=lax<br/>\n Content-Type: text/plain;charset=utf-8<br/>\n Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/static/constraints/ServerManagedPropertyException.rdf\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/static/constraints/ServerManagedPropertyException.rdf</a>&gt;; rel=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#constrainedBy\"<br/>\n Content-Length: 99<br/>\n Server: Jetty(9.4.34.v20201102)</p>\n\n<p>The server managed predicate (<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains</a>) cannot be modified by the client.</p>\n\n<p> </p>",
